---
import LandingLayout from "../layouts/LandingLayout.astro";
import { whatsappLink } from "../lib/brand";
const brandName = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_BRAND_NAME || "Relifish";
---
<LandingLayout
  title={`Refund & Cancellation Policy · ${brandName}`}
  description={`Refund, return, and cancellation policy for ${brandName} — how we handle perishable seafood orders.`}
>
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="legal-header">
      <h1>Refund & Cancellation Policy</h1>
      <p class="legal-updated">Last updated: 22 October 2026</p>
    </div>
    <div class="legal-body">
      <h2>1. Perishable Goods Policy</h2>
      <p>{brandName} is a marketplace where independent local sellers sell fresh fish and seafood. <strong>Because fresh raw fish, shellfish, and seafood are highly perishable food items, standard e-commerce return policies do not apply.</strong></p>
      <p>Once seafood is prepared (scaled, gutted, cleaned, or cut) and dispatched/ready for pickup, we cannot accept returns or support change-of-mind cancellations.</p>

      <h2>2. Cancellation Policy</h2>

      <h3>For Same-Day Orders</h3>
      <ul>
        <li>Same-day orders are prepared and dispatched/made ready for pickup immediately after the shop confirms the order.</li>
        <li><strong>Cancellations are not permitted</strong> once the shop marks the order "Ready" or "Out for delivery", except for a late delivery (see below).</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>For Pre-Orders</h3>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Before Cutoff:</strong> You can cancel a pre-order until the shop's pre-order cutoff for its delivery day (shown on the shop's page), with a full refund.</li>
        <li><strong>What You Pay:</strong> You pay the listed pre-order price when you order. If the shop shows a price range, you pay the top of the range.</li>
        <li><strong>Final Price:</strong> Because the price depends on the catch, the shop sets the final price for your order once it has the fish.</li>
        <li><strong>If the Final Price Is Lower:</strong> the difference is refunded automatically to your original payment method.</li>
        <li><strong>If the Final Price Is Higher:</strong> you are asked to pay the difference before the order goes ahead. If you don't want to, you can cancel the order for a full refund.</li>
        <li><strong>After Cutoff:</strong> a pre-order can't be cancelled once the cutoff has passed, until the shop sets the final price. It can't be cancelled once the shop marks it "Ready" or "Out for delivery", except for a late delivery (see below).</li>
      </ul>

      <h3>Late Delivery</h3>
      <p>If your order hasn't arrived 1 hour after the end of its delivery time, you can cancel it for a full refund to your original payment method, even if it is already out for delivery. If the Cancel button isn't shown on your order page, message us and we'll cancel it for you.</p>

      <h3>A Reason Is Needed to Cancel</h3>
      <p>Whoever cancels an order, you or the shop, gives a short written reason.</p>

      <h3>When the Shop Cancels</h3>
      <p>Shops make every effort to fulfil all accepted orders. However, because they rely on real daily catches, the shop may cancel your order if:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>The specific species of fish was not caught or landed that morning.</li>
        <li>The morning landing fails to meet quality, freshness, or food safety standards.</li>
        <li>Severe weather or sea conditions restrict fishermen from going out.</li>
      </ul>
      <p>If the shop cancels your order, you will be notified with its reason, and any payment will be refunded in full to your original payment method.</p>

      <h2>3. Quality, Weight & Freshness Disputes</h2>
      <p>To resolve any problem with your order quickly, please:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Inspection at Receipt:</strong> Buyers must inspect the seafood's freshness, cuts, cleaning, and weight immediately upon home delivery or self-pickup.</li>
        <li><strong>Immediate Reporting:</strong> If you receive the incorrect species, incorrect weight, poor cleaning, or are unsatisfied with the quality, you must tell us immediately upon receipt and we'll check with the shop.</li>
        <li><strong>Resolution:</strong> All approved refunds (for cancellations, missing items, or verified quality disputes) will be initiated by {brandName} back to your original payment method. We will assist in coordinating with the shop to resolve the dispute and ensure you are credited promptly.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>4. Refund Processing</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Once a refund is approved by the shop or our support team, {brandName} will initiate the refund through our payment gateway (Razorpay).</li>
        <li>The refunded amount will be credited back to your original payment method (UPI, credit/debit card, or net banking) typically within 5 to 7 business days, depending on your bank's processing time.</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>5. Support & Assistance</h2>
      <p>If you have a problem with an order or a dispute, message us and we'll check with the shop.</p>
      <p>{brandName} · Mumbai, India · <a href={whatsappLink("Hi Relifish, I have a question")} target="_blank" rel="noopener">WhatsApp +91 91522 07607</a> · <a href="mailto:relifishstore@gmail.com">relifishstore@gmail.com</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</LandingLayout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 56px 24px 80px;
  }
  .legal-header {
    border-bottom: 2px solid #e2e8f0;
    padding-bottom: 24px;
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }
  .legal-header h1 {
    font: 900 36px/1.2 Inter, sans-serif;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin: 0 0 8px;
  }
  .legal-updated {
    font: 400 13px Inter, sans-serif;
    color: #94a3b8;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .legal-body {
    font: 400 15px/1.7 Inter, sans-serif;
    color: #334155;
  }
  .legal-body h2 {
    font: 700 18px Inter, sans-serif;
    color: #0f172a;
    margin: 36px 0 12px;
    padding-bottom: 6px;
    border-bottom: 1px solid #f1f5f9;
  }
  .legal-body h3 {
    font: 700 16px Inter, sans-serif;
    color: #1e293b;
    margin: 22px 0 10px;
  }
  .legal-body p { margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .legal-body ul { padding-left: 22px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .legal-body li { margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .legal-body a { color: #0066ff; font-weight: 500; }
  .legal-body strong { color: #0f172a; font-weight: 600; }
  @media (max-width: 600px) {
    .legal-page { padding: 36px 16px 60px; }
    .legal-header h1 { font-size: 28px; }
  }
</style>
